# Project config

| Concern | Choice |
|---|---|
| Framework | TanStack Start (React 19, file routes, server functions), Vite 8 |
| Runtime | Cloudflare Workers via `@cloudflare/vite-plugin`; `wrangler.jsonc` |
| Data | D1 binding `DB`, R2 binding `PHOTOS` |
| Styling | Tailwind v4 (CSS-first tokens in `src/styles/global.css`), self-hosted `@fontsource` fonts |
| Auth | Google OIDC (PKCE) → signed 8h session cookie; roles in D1 `staff` |
| Payments | Stripe Checkout over `fetch`; webhook `/api/stripe-webhook` |
| Maps | Google Geocoding + Static Maps (server-side key); route order by `domain/route/route-planner.ts` |
| Email | Resend over `fetch` |

Secrets live in `.dev.vars` locally (git-ignored; template `.dev.vars.example`) and Worker secrets in production. Never read or print them.
